B.Fa=new A.a5(B.Fw,["GaonBazaar","Your Village Hyperlocal Delivery Market","Select Your Language","Choose your preferred language for the app","\u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940 (Hindi)","English","Continue","Enter Mobile Number","Enter your 10-digit mobile number for OTP verification","10-digit mobile number","Get OTP","Please enter a valid 10-digit mobile number (starts with 6-9)","Enter the 6-digit OTP sent to","Verify OTP","Resend OTP","Resend OTP in","seconds","Verify & Proceed","Invalid OTP code. Please enter the correct 6-digit PIN","Security: Never share your OTP with anyone. GaonBazaar representatives never ask for your verification code.","Home","AI Assistant","Cart","Orders","Account","Deliver to","Search grocery, vegetables, dairy, atta...","Listening... Speak your grocery search",'Say something like: "2 kg potato" or "1 litre milk"',"Categories","Featured Village Stores","Verified Kirana Stores in Minapur Block","Village Essentials & Products","View All","ADD","In Stock","Out of Stock","15-25 mins","Verified Store","No active stores found within 8.0 km radius","No products matching your search","Grocery & Ration","Vegetables & Fruits","Dairy & Fresh Milk","Pooja Essentials","Electrical & Hardware","General Store","GaonBazaar AI Assistant","Order by voice in Hindi, English, or Hinglish","Hello! I am your GaonBazaar Voice Assistant. You can speak in Hindi, English, or Hinglish to add grocery items to your cart, check prices, or view your cart.","Listening... Speak now","Add 2 kg chakki atta","Add 1 litre fresh milk","Search for fresh onions","Show my cart","Tap microphone to speak",u.v,"My Cart","Your cart is empty","Browse daily essentials from nearby stores and add them to your cart.","Bill Summary","Item Total","Delivery Partner Fee","Platform Fee","GaonBazaar Rural Development Fee: Flat 3.00","Total Amount","Proceed to Checkout","Clear Cart","Your cart contains items from another store. Replace cart with items from this store?","Checkout","Delivery Address","Change Address","Select Payment Method","Cash on Delivery (COD)","Pay cash or UPI upon receiving delivery at your doorstep","Online UPI / Card / NetBanking","Pay securely with PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm, or Cards","Place Order","Order Placed Successfully!","Order placement failed. Please verify delivery location within 8.0 km.","Live Order Tracking","Delivery Verification PIN","Share this 4-digit code with the delivery partner upon arrival","Cancel Order","You can cancel with 0 penalty within 180 seconds of placement","Cancellation window closed (180s expired)","Order successfully cancelled within 180s window.","Order Placed","Store Accepted","Packed & Ready","Runner Assigned","Picked Up by Runner","Out for Delivery","Delivered","Cancelled","Call Store","Call Delivery Partner","Need Help with this Order?","Items Ordered","My Orders","No orders yet","You have not placed any orders yet. Start shopping village essentials now!","Order #","Placed on","My Profile","My Addresses","Payment Settings","App Settings","Help & Support Hub","Policies & Legal","Logout","Are you sure you want to log out of your account?","Cancel","Confirm","Save","My Profile","Personal Information","Full Name","Mobile Number","Verified (Read-Only)","Email Address (Optional)","Save Profile Changes","Profile updated successfully","My Delivery Addresses","Add New Address","Edit Address","Use My Current Location","Select on Map","Enter Address Manually","Saved Addresses","Village / Locality *","Nearby Landmark (Mandir, School, Banyan Tree) *","House / Building / Household (Optional)","Street / Road / Lane (Optional)","Gram Panchayat (Optional)","Post Office (Optional)","Block *","District *","State *","PIN Code","Contact Person Name *","Contact Mobile Number *","Address Label","Home","Work","Other","Save Delivery Address","Set as Default Address","Delete Address","Address saved successfully","Within service area (8.0 km radius)","Outside service area: Store is more than 8.0 km away","Payment Settings","Cash on Delivery (COD)","Active: Pay cash or UPI directly to delivery partner","Online Payment (UPI, Cards, NetBanking)","100% Secure Payment Protection: Certified encrypted transactions via PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm, BHIM UPI, and all major bank cards.","Supported UPI Apps: PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm, BHIM","Payment FAQs","App Settings","Appearance","Light Theme","Dark Theme","Application Language","Notifications","Order Status Alerts","Android System Permissions","Open Phone Settings","Help & Support Hub","GaonBazaar AI Support Assistant","Ask questions about orders, missing items, or refunds","Where is My Order?","Report an Issue with an Order","My Support Tickets","Cancellation & Refund Guidelines","Frequently Asked Questions","Issue Category","Describe your issue in detail","Submit Support Request","Support ticket created successfully. Our team will resolve within 30 minutes.","Emergency Help Line: +91 9800000000","Policies & Legal","1. 8.0 km Delivery Radius Policy","GaonBazaar operates strictly within an 8.0 km radius from participating stores in Minapur Block. Orders exceeding this geographical threshold are automatically blocked by the geofence engine to guarantee freshness and rapid delivery.","2. Fixed 3.00 Platform Fee","Every order includes a non-negotiable rural platform fee of 3.00. This nominal fee directly funds local runner insurance and technological maintenance of our village delivery network.","3. 180-Second Zero-Penalty Cancellation","Customers have a strict 180-second (3-minute) window immediately following order placement to cancel with a 100% full refund. Once 180 seconds elapse, the store initiates packing and cancellation is locked.","4. Damaged or Missing Item Resolution","Any damaged, spoiled, or missing item reported via the Help & Support Hub within 2 hours of delivery will be investigated and refunded or replaced promptly.",u.F,"Retry","Loading...","GaonBazaar Vendor Partner","Shopkeeper Partner Login","Register New Store","Pending Admin Approval","Your store is currently under verification by Super Admin. You will be able to go online once approved.","Online","Offline","Store is online \u2014 accepting incoming village orders.","Store is offline \u2014 customers cannot place new orders.","New Orders","In Packing","Ready for Pickup","Completed","Accept Order","Reject","Mark Packed","Hand Off to Runner","Call Delivery Partner","Inventory Management","Central Product Library","Earnings & Settlements","Vendor Helpdesk","0% Commission Partner","In Stock","Out of Stock","Add to My Store","Product added to inventory","Stock updated","Total Sales","Commission Deducted (0%)","Net Payout Due","GaonBazaar Delivery Partner","Delivery Partner Login","On Duty","Off Duty","Your runner profile is pending Admin approval. You will receive assignments once verified.","Available Deliveries","Accept Delivery","Decline","Pickup Store","Call Store","Confirm Pickup","Deliver to Customer","Call Customer","Enter 4-Digit Delivery PIN","Verify PIN & Complete Delivery","Delivery Completed Successfully!","Today's Earnings","Trips Completed","COD Cash Collected to Remit","Runner Emergency Helpline: +91 9800000000"],t.w)
